
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Format: <type>(<group>): <short summary>
#
# Types:
#   feat     → new feature
#   fix      → bug fix
#   doc      → documentation
#   test     → add or update tests
#   refactor → restructuring without behavior change
#   chore    → maintenance, configuration
#
# Group: g1, g2, g3, g4, g5 (optional if the change spans several groups)
#
# Summary: 50 characters max, imperative mood, no trailing period
#
# Examples:
#   feat(g2): add first prototype
#   fix(g3): fix file loading
#   doc: update README
#
# If needed, leave a blank line then explain:
#   - why this change
#   - what was changed
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
